@startuml dialog-state
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> Loaded : plugin opened
Loaded : layers read from .kicad_pcb
Loaded : BOM fields read from .kicad_sch
Loaded : kicad_release_profile.json applied
Loaded --> Loaded : edit tabs /\nsave or load profile
Loaded --> Generating : Generate
Generating --> Loaded : validation error\n(message box)
Generating --> Running : files written
Running : RunLogDialog streams kicad-cli
Running --> Loaded : Close / Stop
@enduml
